  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialogueLines:
  - '*Finally, a safe zone...*'
  - '*That was quite the battle*'
  - '*I''m honestly surprised this place isn''t swarming with plants. It''s not like
    we''re that far away from the forest.* '
  - '*Wait... seems like they have some kind of laser turret set up here.*'
  - '*I bet I could mount that on my van, if nobody''s looking...*'
  - '*No, what am I thinking, that would doom this sanctuary.*'
  - '*I already have plenty of good weapons.*'
  - '*Other people need it more than I do.*'
